    en: 'CAT 336D Hydraulic Excavator. Engine: Caterpillar C9 Diesel (206 kW/276 HP). Bucket Capacity: 2.1 m³. Max Digging Depth: 7.5 m. Boom Length: 7.4 m. Stick Length: 2.8 m. Undercarriage: Rubber Track (800mm). Hydraulic System: 280 bar. Fuel Tank: 300 L. Swing Speed: 11 rpm. Travel Speed: 4.5 km/h. Perfect for large-scale mining, quarrying, and heavy construction.',
